1
00:01:26,545 --> 00:01:31,025
The Scholar and the Emperor

2
00:01:45,705 --> 00:01:48,025
Your Majesty, he has confessed.

3
00:01:48,105 --> 00:01:49,545
He was indeed acting on orders
from the Tiger's Roar Gang.

4
00:01:49,625 --> 00:01:52,065
Mercy, Your Majesty!

5
00:02:11,545 --> 00:02:13,065
Your Majesty, an urgent memorial.

6
00:02:15,945 --> 00:02:17,625
Your Majesty, an urgent report
from the Imperial Astronomical Bureau.

7
00:02:17,705 --> 00:02:18,825
There is an ominous celestial sign.

8
00:02:18,905 --> 00:02:20,225
The Left Chancellor and the ministers

9
00:02:20,305 --> 00:02:22,145
have long awaited Your Majesty
at the Astronomical Observatory.

10
00:02:22,785 --> 00:02:23,625
A celestial sign?

11
00:02:30,265 --> 00:02:31,225
Recently, His Majesty

12
00:02:31,305 --> 00:02:32,745
has repeatedly visited
the Office of Public Inquiry

13
00:02:32,825 --> 00:02:33,985
to comfort Meng Tinghui.

14
00:02:34,785 --> 00:02:35,945
Today, for her sake,

15
00:02:36,025 --> 00:02:38,345
he even sent the Divine Guard
to parade the culprit through the streets.

16
00:02:38,425 --> 00:02:39,745
Such a grand display

17
00:02:39,825 --> 00:02:41,225
is surely excessive favoritism.

18
00:02:41,305 --> 00:02:42,785
Rumors have long circulated

19
00:02:43,345 --> 00:02:44,385
that His Majesty and she

20
00:02:44,465 --> 00:02:45,945
share a bond from their youth,

21
00:02:46,025 --> 00:02:47,625
yet are also sovereign and subject.

22
00:02:47,705 --> 00:02:49,625
Sooner or later,
it will disrupt the court.

23
00:02:49,705 --> 00:02:51,305
The palace rules
and ancestral laws are clear.

24
00:02:52,385 --> 00:02:53,745
The throne hall of Daning

25
00:02:54,465 --> 00:02:55,745
must not become a den of romance.

26
00:02:55,825 --> 00:02:58,825
His Majesty arrives!

27
00:03:04,825 --> 00:03:06,545
-Your Majesty.
-Your Majesty.

28
00:03:06,625 --> 00:03:07,465
Rise.

29
00:03:12,225 --> 00:03:13,225
Your Majesty,

30
00:03:13,305 --> 00:03:15,065
I have studied the heavens nightly

31
00:03:15,145 --> 00:03:16,505
and found that the unending rains

32
00:03:16,585 --> 00:03:18,305
are linked to celestial disturbances.

33
00:03:18,385 --> 00:03:19,545
Since the rains began,

34
00:03:20,145 --> 00:03:20,985
I have ordered every ministry

35
00:03:21,065 --> 00:03:22,905
to closely monitor the disasters
in each prefecture

36
00:03:22,985 --> 00:03:24,265
and prepare relief measures.

37
00:03:24,825 --> 00:03:26,225
Your Majesty, that is not the issue.

38
00:03:26,305 --> 00:03:28,185
The heavens reveal
that calamity lies within the palace.

39
00:03:28,745 --> 00:03:30,385
The Purple Star has dimmed,

40
00:03:30,465 --> 00:03:31,705
while the Kun position hangs unmoored,

41
00:03:31,785 --> 00:03:32,945
signifying that the inner palace
has no mistress.

42
00:03:33,025 --> 00:03:34,105
Yin and yang are out of balance.

43
00:03:34,185 --> 00:03:36,105
A baleful star encroaches
upon the Red Matchmaker Star.

44
00:03:36,185 --> 00:03:37,785
This is a dire omen.

45
00:03:37,865 --> 00:03:39,265
The Red Matchmaker Star
governs marriage,

46
00:03:39,345 --> 00:03:41,585
signaling that a royal wedding
is imminent.

47
00:03:41,665 --> 00:03:42,825
The baleful star embodies dark forces,

48
00:03:42,905 --> 00:03:45,425
warning that a woman may bring chaos
to the palace.

49
00:03:45,505 --> 00:03:48,185
Your Majesty must quickly
crown an Empress and wed

50
00:03:48,265 --> 00:03:49,265
to accord with the heavens,

51
00:03:49,345 --> 00:03:51,865
end the floods,
and secure the realm.

52
00:03:51,945 --> 00:03:52,985
Interesting.

53
00:03:54,025 --> 00:03:55,185
I never knew

54
00:03:55,265 --> 00:03:57,305
that the realm's safety
and flood-control policy

55
00:03:57,785 --> 00:03:59,745
were all written in the stars.

56
00:03:59,825 --> 00:04:01,785
Even my marriage

57
00:04:01,865 --> 00:04:04,345
is apparently decided
by the stars above.

58
00:04:04,425 --> 00:04:06,625
Your Majesty, in only a few days,

59
00:04:06,705 --> 00:04:07,985
all seven prefectures of Daning

60
00:04:08,065 --> 00:04:09,785
have become a vast flooded land.

61
00:04:09,865 --> 00:04:11,465
Since the rains began,

62
00:04:11,945 --> 00:04:13,785
an image of a fox demon

63
00:04:13,865 --> 00:04:15,665
has spread among the people.

64
00:04:17,385 --> 00:04:18,865
They all say

65
00:04:18,945 --> 00:04:20,145
that Your Majesty

66
00:04:20,225 --> 00:04:22,105
drew close to an ill-fated woman,

67
00:04:22,185 --> 00:04:23,785
incurring Heaven's wrath
and the people's anger.

68
00:04:23,865 --> 00:04:24,905
With floods upon us,

69
00:04:25,905 --> 00:04:26,865
instead of considering

70
00:04:26,945 --> 00:04:28,145
how to reinforce the dikes

71
00:04:28,225 --> 00:04:29,265
and provide disaster relief,

72
00:04:29,345 --> 00:04:30,825
the Left Chancellor brings
street gossip

73
00:04:30,905 --> 00:04:32,505
to impeach an official before the throne.

74
00:04:32,585 --> 00:04:34,705
Do you not fear
the whole realm will mock you?

75
00:04:35,305 --> 00:04:36,345
Your Majesty, judge wisely.

76
00:04:36,425 --> 00:04:38,625
Besides this image of a fox demon,

77
00:04:38,705 --> 00:04:39,705
there is further evidence

78
00:04:40,225 --> 00:04:42,145
to support the celestial prophecy.

79
00:04:48,025 --> 00:04:50,145
The floods across seven prefectures
form a heavenly script.

80
00:04:50,225 --> 00:04:52,145
How could this be the work of man?

81
00:04:52,905 --> 00:04:53,865
Now,

82
00:04:53,945 --> 00:04:55,185
the celestial signs and the floods

83
00:04:55,265 --> 00:04:56,985
both point to Meng Tinghui
as the baleful star.

84
00:04:57,065 --> 00:04:58,345
Your Majesty,

85
00:04:58,425 --> 00:05:01,065
what I have said reflects Heaven's will

86
00:05:01,145 --> 00:05:02,065
and the will of the people.

87
00:05:04,025 --> 00:05:05,105
Lord Meng requests an audience.

88
00:05:05,905 --> 00:05:07,505
The thunder has not yet ceased,

89
00:05:07,585 --> 00:05:09,905
yet you slander a colleague here.

90
00:05:10,505 --> 00:05:12,105
Do you not fear divine punishment?

91
00:05:17,225 --> 00:05:18,865
The celestial instruments
have responded.

92
00:05:18,945 --> 00:05:20,665
It seems the prophecy is true.

93
00:05:21,385 --> 00:05:22,305
Meng Tinghui!

94
00:05:23,185 --> 00:05:24,025
Why is she here?

95
00:05:31,425 --> 00:05:32,385
Meng Tinghui,

96
00:05:33,785 --> 00:05:35,105
you entered the palace
without summons.

97
00:05:35,185 --> 00:05:36,065
Do you admit your offense?

98
00:05:36,625 --> 00:05:38,825
I heard the Left Chancellor
had assembled the ministers

99
00:05:38,905 --> 00:05:39,945
while deliberately excluding me.

100
00:05:40,025 --> 00:05:42,025
Naturally, I came to see for myself.

101
00:05:42,825 --> 00:05:43,905
Your Majesty,

102
00:05:43,985 --> 00:05:44,985
the people's suffering

103
00:05:45,065 --> 00:05:46,305
has all arisen because of me.

104
00:05:46,985 --> 00:05:47,865
I

105
00:05:47,945 --> 00:05:48,785
ask to be put to death.

106
00:05:51,865 --> 00:05:53,585
But I have one request.

107
00:05:54,145 --> 00:05:55,225
If, after my death,

108
00:05:55,705 --> 00:05:57,745
the rain does not stop
and the floods do not recede,

109
00:05:57,825 --> 00:06:00,345
then the Left Chancellor
and Director Lu

110
00:06:00,825 --> 00:06:02,185
must offer their lives
before the realm

111
00:06:02,745 --> 00:06:04,025
to atone for misleading the nation.

112
00:06:04,105 --> 00:06:06,465
Left Chancellor, Director Lu,

113
00:06:06,545 --> 00:06:08,145
you claim again and again

114
00:06:08,225 --> 00:06:09,945
to act for the realm.

115
00:06:10,025 --> 00:06:11,465
Then do you dare

116
00:06:11,545 --> 00:06:12,905
sign this pact of life and death?

117
00:06:12,985 --> 00:06:14,665
How dare you!

118
00:06:14,745 --> 00:06:16,505
You dare threaten me?

119
00:06:16,585 --> 00:06:18,425
If the Left Chancellor truly trusts

120
00:06:18,505 --> 00:06:19,985
these celestial signs
and Heaven's will,

121
00:06:20,065 --> 00:06:20,985
what is there to fear?

122
00:06:21,785 --> 00:06:23,345
Your Majesty, Left Chancellor,

123
00:06:23,425 --> 00:06:26,505
this demoness stopped at nothing
against the Tiger's Roar Gang.

124
00:06:27,145 --> 00:06:27,985
I hear that this time

125
00:06:28,065 --> 00:06:29,825
she escaped by seducing the thugs.

126
00:06:29,905 --> 00:06:31,745
Her death would be no loss,

127
00:06:31,825 --> 00:06:34,065
but we must not fall for her scheme.

128
00:06:34,545 --> 00:06:36,545
The first woman to win
all three imperial examinations

129
00:06:36,625 --> 00:06:38,705
committed such a disgraceful act.

130
00:06:39,225 --> 00:06:40,145
To serve beside her in this hall

131
00:06:40,225 --> 00:06:42,265
is our greatest shame.

132
00:06:42,345 --> 00:06:44,145
I implore Your Majesty

133
00:06:44,225 --> 00:06:45,745
to punish this demoness.

134
00:06:45,825 --> 00:06:47,585
Only then will the rain cease

135
00:06:47,665 --> 00:06:50,065
and Heaven's wrath
and public anger subside.

136
00:06:52,545 --> 00:06:55,025
I incurred retaliation
while pursuing criminals.

137
00:06:55,105 --> 00:06:57,185
In mortal danger,
I used lightning to save myself.

138
00:06:58,345 --> 00:07:00,465
Yet that makes me a demoness
in your eyes.

139
00:07:01,705 --> 00:07:03,505
Since you insist I am a demoness,

140
00:07:06,105 --> 00:07:07,425
I will show you

141
00:07:08,585 --> 00:07:11,305
how a demoness defies Heaven
and throws everything into chaos.

142
00:07:13,505 --> 00:07:14,625
Lord Meng!

143
00:07:45,185 --> 00:07:46,145
This is rebellion!

144
00:07:46,225 --> 00:07:48,185
Outright rebellion!

145
00:07:48,265 --> 00:07:49,945
A baleful star brings chaos!

146
00:07:50,025 --> 00:07:51,105
Daji reborn!

147
00:07:53,865 --> 00:07:54,705
Left Chancellor,

148
00:07:55,465 --> 00:07:56,785
the baleful star is not in the sky,

149
00:07:57,385 --> 00:07:58,425
but in the human heart.

150
00:07:58,505 --> 00:08:00,145
Though I was born lowly,

151
00:08:00,225 --> 00:08:03,065
even I know power must serve the people.

152
00:08:03,145 --> 00:08:05,585
You hold the purple sandalwood staff
bestowed by the late Emperor,

153
00:08:05,665 --> 00:08:07,625
yet all you do is form factions
and purge your rivals.

154
00:08:07,705 --> 00:08:08,905
Let me ask you:

155
00:08:10,025 --> 00:08:11,105
at this very moment,

156
00:08:11,945 --> 00:08:14,865
have you thought of the victims
across Daning's seven prefectures?

157
00:08:14,945 --> 00:08:16,465
The people of those prefectures suffer

158
00:08:16,545 --> 00:08:17,745
because of you!

159
00:08:17,825 --> 00:08:18,665
Your Majesty,

160
00:08:19,225 --> 00:08:21,065
will you simply let Meng Tinghui
run wild

161
00:08:21,145 --> 00:08:22,945
-and bewitch you?
-Do not use His Majesty to silence me.

162
00:08:23,025 --> 00:08:24,825
Meng Tinghui,
the Imperial Astronomical Bureau

163
00:08:25,745 --> 00:08:27,705
is no place for you
to brandish weapons.

164
00:08:28,265 --> 00:08:29,745
Does Your Majesty also think I am wrong?

165
00:08:33,585 --> 00:08:34,905
As for right and wrong,

166
00:08:36,705 --> 00:08:38,785
the people and I will await the verdict.

167
00:08:47,145 --> 00:08:47,985
Your Majesty,

168
00:08:48,065 --> 00:08:49,185
Meng Tinghui has acted wantonly

169
00:08:49,265 --> 00:08:50,585
and caused havoc
at the Astronomical Bureau.

170
00:08:50,665 --> 00:08:52,705
If Your Majesty continues
to indulge her,

171
00:08:53,185 --> 00:08:54,665
the whole realm will condemn you.

172
00:08:55,625 --> 00:08:57,425
In my view, the most urgent matter

173
00:08:57,505 --> 00:08:59,065
is for Your Majesty
to crown an Empress

174
00:08:59,145 --> 00:09:00,625
and reassure the people.

175
00:09:02,585 --> 00:09:04,505
I implore Your Majesty

176
00:09:04,585 --> 00:09:06,225
to make Wen Ruomei Empress.

177
00:09:06,305 --> 00:09:07,945
-We implore Your Majesty...
-We implore Your Majesty...

178
00:09:08,025 --> 00:09:10,345
-to put the realm first.
-to put the realm first.

179
00:09:13,985 --> 00:09:16,385
You keep invoking Heaven's will.

180
00:09:16,865 --> 00:09:18,745
But is this truly Heaven's will,

181
00:09:20,305 --> 00:09:22,465
or merely man's?

182
00:09:23,585 --> 00:09:25,825
The Right Chancellor
requests an audience.

183
00:09:32,545 --> 00:09:33,985
I pay my respects, Your Majesty.

184
00:09:34,065 --> 00:09:35,825
Following Your Majesty's decree,

185
00:09:35,905 --> 00:09:37,785
I have urged every ministry
to address the floods.

186
00:09:38,345 --> 00:09:40,025
The first waterwheels
have reached each prefecture.

187
00:09:40,585 --> 00:09:42,265
Though I serve as Right Chancellor,

188
00:09:42,345 --> 00:09:43,585
I came from the Ministry of Works

189
00:09:43,665 --> 00:09:45,385
and know flood control well.

190
00:09:45,465 --> 00:09:47,185
I volunteer to inspect
the prefectures for Your Majesty

191
00:09:47,265 --> 00:09:48,145
and bring relief to the people.

192
00:09:48,225 --> 00:09:49,745
From this day forward,

193
00:09:50,585 --> 00:09:53,065
every prefecture must fully support
the Right Chancellor

194
00:09:53,945 --> 00:09:55,705
in disaster relief.

195
00:09:55,785 --> 00:09:57,905
On behalf of the flood victims,

196
00:09:57,985 --> 00:09:59,105
I thank Your Majesty for your grace.

197
00:09:59,185 --> 00:10:01,265
As for making Wen Ruomei Empress today,

198
00:10:01,345 --> 00:10:03,905
Your Majesty must decide.

199
00:10:04,465 --> 00:10:06,505
Once the disaster has passed
and the people are secure,

200
00:10:06,585 --> 00:10:08,025
I will issue my decree.

201
00:10:08,425 --> 00:10:09,465
But until then,

202
00:10:09,545 --> 00:10:10,625
if anyone else

203
00:10:11,865 --> 00:10:14,625
uses celestial signs or rumors
to attack a court official

204
00:10:14,705 --> 00:10:16,425
and disrupts disaster relief,

205
00:10:17,225 --> 00:10:18,905
they shall be charged
with endangering the nation

206
00:10:18,985 --> 00:10:20,505
and executed on the spot.

207
00:10:38,785 --> 00:10:40,465
The rains have lasted over a month.

208
00:10:41,065 --> 00:10:42,065
Rivers have overflowed,

209
00:10:42,705 --> 00:10:43,665
and homes and fields lie submerged.

210
00:10:44,625 --> 00:10:45,785
I, Meng Tinghui,

211
00:10:46,425 --> 00:10:47,865
submit Ten Measures
to Reassure the People.

212
00:10:48,425 --> 00:10:49,825
May Your Majesty review them.

213
00:10:50,705 --> 00:10:51,745
First, prevent epidemics:

214
00:10:52,505 --> 00:10:53,705
establish one hundred medical tents.

215
00:10:54,945 --> 00:10:56,305
Second, resettle the displaced:

216
00:10:56,385 --> 00:10:57,985
provide relief through public works.

217
00:10:58,065 --> 00:10:59,185
Third, preserve agriculture:

218
00:11:00,065 --> 00:11:01,345
build granaries on high ground.

219
00:11:04,585 --> 00:11:05,625
Mengmeng,

220
00:11:08,905 --> 00:11:10,185
you suffered such injustice.

221
00:11:10,265 --> 00:11:12,145
Why did you not tell me?

222
00:11:12,225 --> 00:11:14,625
Had Zhaocai and Jinbao not sent word,

223
00:11:16,065 --> 00:11:19,345
you cannot imagine
how tormented I was on the way here.

224
00:11:19,425 --> 00:11:20,625
I wanted to cut those two beasts

225
00:11:20,705 --> 00:11:22,585
into a thousand pieces.

226
00:11:22,665 --> 00:11:23,545
It is all right now.

227
00:11:24,825 --> 00:11:26,305
Am I not perfectly fine?

228
00:11:29,145 --> 00:11:30,305
How can you say it is all right?

229
00:11:31,305 --> 00:11:33,185
From Shazhou to the capital,

230
00:11:33,265 --> 00:11:35,105
all I heard was talk about you.

231
00:11:38,225 --> 00:11:39,465
I cannot bear to imagine

232
00:11:39,985 --> 00:11:41,865
how you endured it alone.

233
00:11:43,785 --> 00:11:45,625
I should never have returned to Shazhou.

234
00:11:45,705 --> 00:11:47,825
I should have stayed by your side.

235
00:11:51,425 --> 00:11:52,305
Fuzhi.

236
00:11:53,585 --> 00:11:54,505
Enough.

237
00:11:55,625 --> 00:11:56,945
Stop crying.

238
00:11:58,185 --> 00:11:59,065
What happened to those two beasts?

239
00:11:59,665 --> 00:12:00,505
Are they dead?

240
00:12:06,185 --> 00:12:07,385
His Majesty had them executed.

241
00:12:07,985 --> 00:12:09,865
I wish I could dig them up

242
00:12:09,945 --> 00:12:11,305
and cut them into pieces.

243
00:12:13,785 --> 00:12:15,105
Then my father could see

244
00:12:15,185 --> 00:12:16,225
that digging up a corpse

245
00:12:16,305 --> 00:12:17,865
is hardly worth making a fuss over.

246
00:12:19,865 --> 00:12:20,705
Enough.

247
00:12:22,185 --> 00:12:23,105
When you returned to Shazhou,

248
00:12:24,065 --> 00:12:24,945
how was your father?

249
00:12:26,705 --> 00:12:27,905
He tricked me into going back

250
00:12:28,945 --> 00:12:29,785
and tried to force me to marry.

251
00:12:33,185 --> 00:12:34,305
Now I finally understand:

252
00:12:34,985 --> 00:12:36,545
you are the only one
who has always treated me well.

253
00:12:38,025 --> 00:12:39,265
But this time,

254
00:12:39,345 --> 00:12:40,785
I failed to protect you.

255
00:12:43,225 --> 00:12:45,985
The spring floods happen every year.

256
00:12:46,065 --> 00:12:47,345
They were merely fiercer this year.

257
00:12:47,425 --> 00:12:48,945
Why should you take the blame?

258
00:12:49,625 --> 00:12:51,105
Celestial warnings,

259
00:12:51,985 --> 00:12:53,105
prophetic nursery rhymes,

260
00:12:53,185 --> 00:12:54,225
seduction and murder...

261
00:12:54,785 --> 00:12:55,865
All of it was clearly

262
00:12:55,945 --> 00:12:57,225
that old scoundrel

263
00:12:57,305 --> 00:12:59,185
Xu Ting stirring up trouble.

264
00:13:04,225 --> 00:13:05,825
I did not expect even you to know.

265
00:13:07,145 --> 00:13:08,905
If the news spread this quickly,

266
00:13:09,825 --> 00:13:12,145
the whole of Daning
must have heard it by now.

267
00:13:12,825 --> 00:13:14,145
Do not take it to heart.

268
00:13:14,665 --> 00:13:15,825
Those absurd rumors—

269
00:13:15,905 --> 00:13:17,145
I do not believe a word.

270
00:13:18,545 --> 00:13:20,745
His Majesty certainly will not either.

271
00:13:26,865 --> 00:13:27,705
Mengmeng,

272
00:13:28,425 --> 00:13:29,505
tell me the truth.

273
00:13:30,465 --> 00:13:31,505
Do you have feelings

274
00:13:33,745 --> 00:13:34,825
for His Majesty...?

275
00:13:44,345 --> 00:13:45,425
Of course not.

276
00:13:49,145 --> 00:13:50,785
I saw how close you two had become,

277
00:13:50,865 --> 00:13:52,025
and I thought...

278
00:13:53,625 --> 00:13:54,585
Good. Better that you do not.

279
00:13:55,705 --> 00:13:56,865
The imperial family

280
00:13:56,945 --> 00:13:58,785
is bound by rigid palace rules
and ancestral law.

281
00:13:58,865 --> 00:14:00,545
One misstep could cost your life.

282
00:14:00,625 --> 00:14:01,945
Besides,

283
00:14:02,025 --> 00:14:03,305
His Majesty has not yet named an Empress,

284
00:14:03,385 --> 00:14:04,785
and he is already preparing
to take consorts.

285
00:14:04,865 --> 00:14:06,745
With three palaces and six courts,

286
00:14:07,385 --> 00:14:08,225
there will be endless intrigue.

287
00:14:08,305 --> 00:14:09,505
That life does not suit you.

288
00:14:20,985 --> 00:14:21,825
In my eyes,

289
00:14:22,505 --> 00:14:24,825
you deserve the very best in the world.

290
00:14:29,985 --> 00:14:31,345
(Blood Moon Society)

291
00:14:31,425 --> 00:14:32,505
Sir.

292
00:14:32,585 --> 00:14:34,825
From our joint sale
of Infinite Bliss Pills with Ling Yunfei,

293
00:14:34,905 --> 00:14:37,065
the first payment totals
thirty thousand taels.

294
00:14:37,145 --> 00:14:38,545
As for the private mine at Wanshan,

295
00:14:38,625 --> 00:14:40,785
it was sealed after Shen Zhishu
investigated it.

296
00:14:40,865 --> 00:14:42,065
To avoid jeopardizing our plans,

297
00:14:42,145 --> 00:14:43,545
I found another route.

298
00:14:43,625 --> 00:14:44,825
On the black market in Beijian,

299
00:14:44,905 --> 00:14:46,305
I ordered three hundred weapons.

300
00:14:46,385 --> 00:14:47,745
The deal can be completed
in seven days.

301
00:14:47,825 --> 00:14:49,985
It will not affect
any Blood Moon Society operation.

302
00:14:50,585 --> 00:14:51,545
Sir,

303
00:14:51,625 --> 00:14:53,425
when we returned to the old Zhongwan lands
in Qingzhou,

304
00:14:53,505 --> 00:14:55,665
we found the floods had worsened.

305
00:14:56,145 --> 00:14:57,905
To protect fertile land upstream,
Daning's corrupt officials

306
00:14:57,985 --> 00:14:59,665
blew up the dikes to release the flood.

307
00:14:59,745 --> 00:15:02,065
Half of Wannu Camp,
home to Zhongwan survivors, was submerged.

308
00:15:02,665 --> 00:15:03,785
Bodies were floating

309
00:15:03,865 --> 00:15:04,905
across the water.

310
00:15:05,545 --> 00:15:06,385
The youngest victim

311
00:15:07,225 --> 00:15:08,065
was only three.

312
00:15:09,185 --> 00:15:11,145
Many of our people
can only chew bark to survive.

313
00:15:11,665 --> 00:15:13,385
Some even fight wild dogs for food.

314
00:15:13,985 --> 00:15:16,625
Many elders starved themselves

315
00:15:17,705 --> 00:15:18,945
so their grandchildren
could have one more bite.

316
00:15:23,785 --> 00:15:24,625
Sir,

317
00:15:25,145 --> 00:15:27,345
the people of Zhongwan
are suffering now.

318
00:15:27,425 --> 00:15:28,505
Should this money

319
00:15:29,065 --> 00:15:30,745
buy the weapons as planned,

320
00:15:31,305 --> 00:15:33,025
or should we use it first
for food and medicine

321
00:15:33,505 --> 00:15:34,345
to settle them?

322
00:15:34,825 --> 00:15:35,785
The weapons trade

323
00:15:35,865 --> 00:15:37,345
is already a deadly business.

324
00:15:38,025 --> 00:15:39,305
If we break our word this time,

325
00:15:39,385 --> 00:15:41,665
who in the underworld
will ever trade with us again?

326
00:15:42,225 --> 00:15:43,905
Weapons can wait. Lives cannot.

327
00:15:44,545 --> 00:15:45,905
We have endured in silence for ten years.

328
00:15:46,825 --> 00:15:48,545
We cannot let everything

329
00:15:48,625 --> 00:15:49,825
be ruined for a few starving weaklings.

330
00:15:50,705 --> 00:15:52,305
When we restore our nation,

331
00:15:52,385 --> 00:15:54,145
I will make Daning's corrupt officials

332
00:15:54,825 --> 00:15:56,585
pay for it with their blood.

333
00:15:57,625 --> 00:15:58,465
Sir,

334
00:15:59,545 --> 00:16:00,505
only while our people live

335
00:16:01,225 --> 00:16:02,665
can our grievance remain a blood debt.

336
00:16:03,505 --> 00:16:05,185
If even this bloodline dies out,

337
00:16:06,385 --> 00:16:07,345
what use are the weapons?

338
00:16:11,105 --> 00:16:13,265
The cause of restoration
allows no softness.

339
00:16:15,505 --> 00:16:16,745
Starving women and children

340
00:16:17,305 --> 00:16:18,945
will only inflame public anger

341
00:16:19,665 --> 00:16:22,585
and help the Blood Moon Society
recruit men willing to die.

342
00:16:25,545 --> 00:16:26,985
I sealed the private mine,

343
00:16:27,065 --> 00:16:28,825
but they seemed to realize
I was following them.

344
00:16:28,905 --> 00:16:29,785
They suddenly turned back.

345
00:16:29,865 --> 00:16:31,905
After buying spices and timber
at a border market,

346
00:16:31,985 --> 00:16:32,825
nothing else seemed suspicious.

347
00:16:33,625 --> 00:16:35,065
Their sudden change of route

348
00:16:35,145 --> 00:16:37,305
may have been caused by a warning
from Situ Xue.

349
00:16:37,865 --> 00:16:38,945
I thought so too.

350
00:16:39,025 --> 00:16:40,025
So I played along,

351
00:16:40,105 --> 00:16:41,745
pretending not to notice anything,

352
00:16:41,825 --> 00:16:43,425
and deliberately diverted to Shazhou.

353
00:16:43,505 --> 00:16:44,705
In truth, I had already sent men

354
00:16:44,785 --> 00:16:46,065
to watch them in secret.

355
00:16:46,145 --> 00:16:47,185
They found this.

356
00:16:50,865 --> 00:16:52,225
The Blood Moon Society.

357
00:16:52,745 --> 00:16:54,985
It seems Situ Xue and Huiyin House
are merely a front.

358
00:16:55,625 --> 00:16:58,105
They secretly work
for the Blood Moon Society.

359
00:16:59,225 --> 00:17:00,465
This Blood Moon Society

360
00:17:01,025 --> 00:17:02,025
may be the force behind

361
00:17:02,105 --> 00:17:03,865
the weapons purchases in Shazhou.

362
00:17:04,425 --> 00:17:05,945
If so,

363
00:17:06,025 --> 00:17:08,625
they tried to buy weapons
in bulk in Shazhou,

364
00:17:08,705 --> 00:17:10,625
then opened a private mine
when that was blocked.

365
00:17:10,705 --> 00:17:11,905
What are they planning?

366
00:17:11,985 --> 00:17:13,985
Do you remember what I told you?

367
00:17:14,065 --> 00:17:16,305
After the Zhongwan royal clan
was destroyed,

368
00:17:16,385 --> 00:17:18,265
a mysterious force vanished
without a trace.

369
00:17:18,745 --> 00:17:21,225
The Blood Moon Society
may be connected to them.

370
00:17:21,305 --> 00:17:22,825
Could they be trying
to restore their kingdom?

371
00:17:24,625 --> 00:17:26,945
No wonder the Xiyan flower
symbolizes vengeance.

372
00:17:27,025 --> 00:17:28,185
They have been secretly

373
00:17:28,265 --> 00:17:29,465
planning a restoration all along.

374
00:17:29,545 --> 00:17:30,745
Your Majesty,

375
00:17:30,825 --> 00:17:32,865
should we immediately
seal Huiyin House?

376
00:17:32,945 --> 00:17:34,305
No.

377
00:17:34,545 --> 00:17:36,385
We have not yet seen
the Blood Moon Society in full.

378
00:17:36,465 --> 00:17:38,465
If we close the net now,
we will only catch its pawns.

379
00:17:38,545 --> 00:17:40,225
Keep Huiyin House under watch.

380
00:17:40,305 --> 00:17:41,945
Follow the trail through Situ Xue.

381
00:17:42,025 --> 00:17:44,025
It will lead us
to the Society's mastermind.

382
00:17:44,705 --> 00:17:45,705
Yes.

383
00:17:48,345 --> 00:17:49,185
Your Majesty,

384
00:17:49,265 --> 00:17:50,705
I have reported everything.

385
00:17:50,785 --> 00:17:52,385
Now please give me a clear answer.

386
00:17:52,465 --> 00:17:54,465
Miss Yan traveled back with me,

387
00:17:54,545 --> 00:17:55,945
crying the entire way.

388
00:17:56,025 --> 00:17:57,465
Lord Meng had already been wronged,

389
00:17:57,545 --> 00:17:59,305
yet the Astronomical Bureau
spouted false omens,

390
00:17:59,385 --> 00:18:01,105
and even the Left Chancellor
used the chance to attack her.

391
00:18:01,185 --> 00:18:02,265
Even I think

392
00:18:02,345 --> 00:18:03,505
Lord Meng is truly pitiable.

393
00:18:05,705 --> 00:18:06,585
Your Majesty,

394
00:18:07,065 --> 00:18:08,745
why not reassign Lord Meng
to another post?

395
00:18:09,305 --> 00:18:10,305
If she were willing to give up,

396
00:18:10,385 --> 00:18:11,665
she would not be Meng Tinghui.

397
00:18:11,745 --> 00:18:13,505
She now pursues
the Tiger's Roar Gang

398
00:18:13,585 --> 00:18:15,345
not for personal vengeance,

399
00:18:15,425 --> 00:18:16,785
but for the people of Daning.

400
00:18:17,785 --> 00:18:20,025
Besides the old Zhongwan case,

401
00:18:20,625 --> 00:18:23,065
I want you to oversee the Office
and keep her safe.

402
00:18:25,305 --> 00:18:27,145
Your Majesty cares for Lord Meng

403
00:18:27,225 --> 00:18:29,265
far more than I imagined.

404
00:18:30,065 --> 00:18:33,465
Then will you still marry
Minister Wen's daughter as a consort?

405
00:19:01,465 --> 00:19:02,465
My lord,

406
00:19:02,545 --> 00:19:03,505
I made this Rain Chime.

407
00:19:07,305 --> 00:19:08,305
Even on a rainy day,

408
00:19:08,945 --> 00:19:10,185
you can see a rainbow through it.

409
00:19:10,745 --> 00:19:11,745
It is a good omen.

410
00:19:12,145 --> 00:19:12,985
Soon,

411
00:19:13,505 --> 00:19:14,745
the skies will clear.

412
00:19:15,305 --> 00:19:17,585
People say such craftsmanship
is only a myth.

413
00:19:18,305 --> 00:19:20,585
Today, you proved them wrong.

414
00:19:23,305 --> 00:19:24,505
I have not seen you smile in so long.

415
00:19:25,745 --> 00:19:26,825
You look beautiful when you smile.

416
00:19:28,185 --> 00:19:29,985
Even the rainbow in the sky

417
00:19:30,065 --> 00:19:31,185
pales

418
00:19:31,985 --> 00:19:32,825
beside you.

419
00:19:34,585 --> 00:19:35,985
Do not flatter me.

420
00:19:37,185 --> 00:19:38,025
My lord,

421
00:19:38,985 --> 00:19:40,345
no matter how fierce the storms,

422
00:19:41,425 --> 00:19:42,705
they will always end one day.

423
00:19:45,465 --> 00:19:46,905
I cannot stop the wind and rain,

424
00:19:48,065 --> 00:19:49,865
but I can harness their force.

425
00:20:06,545 --> 00:20:07,665
This is a little device
I always keep at hand.

426
00:20:08,505 --> 00:20:09,545
Take it for protection.

427
00:20:19,225 --> 00:20:20,905
If I truly face danger,

428
00:20:22,185 --> 00:20:23,985
a little device will not be enough.

429
00:20:24,065 --> 00:20:25,345
After following you for so long,

430
00:20:25,945 --> 00:20:27,065
I have improved too.

431
00:20:27,625 --> 00:20:29,585
I prepared a perfect solution for you.

432
00:20:30,425 --> 00:20:31,425
This is a sleeve crossbow.

433
00:20:31,505 --> 00:20:33,025
It will not injure your hand when worn

434
00:20:33,105 --> 00:20:34,105
and is hard for others to notice.

435
00:20:38,945 --> 00:20:39,905
Rainbow marbles,

436
00:20:46,145 --> 00:20:46,985
concealed darts,

437
00:20:49,385 --> 00:20:50,225
and...

438
00:20:53,065 --> 00:20:54,265
Yin Qing.

439
00:20:55,785 --> 00:20:56,905
Thank you.

440
00:21:00,865 --> 00:21:01,785
My lord,

441
00:21:02,785 --> 00:21:03,705
as long as I am here,

442
00:21:04,505 --> 00:21:05,465
I will keep you safe.

443
00:21:35,745 --> 00:21:37,625
Who goes there?
How dare you enter the Office!

444
00:22:22,945 --> 00:22:24,065
-Your Majesty.
-Your Majesty.

445
00:22:27,505 --> 00:22:28,785
Rise.

446
00:22:30,705 --> 00:22:31,665
Your Majesty,

447
00:22:32,225 --> 00:22:33,065
what is this?

448
00:22:37,385 --> 00:22:38,705
-Lord Meng.
-Lord Meng.

449
00:22:39,785 --> 00:22:41,065
When the Office of Public Inquiry
was established,

450
00:22:41,145 --> 00:22:42,825
I did not assign it dedicated guards.

451
00:22:42,905 --> 00:22:44,065
That was an oversight.

452
00:22:44,145 --> 00:22:46,505
These are twelve light cavalrymen
I selected personally.

453
00:22:46,585 --> 00:22:48,145
Each is highly skilled in combat.

454
00:22:48,225 --> 00:22:49,105
From today onward,

455
00:22:49,185 --> 00:22:50,705
they will belong
to the Office of Public Inquiry

456
00:22:50,785 --> 00:22:51,665
and answer to your command.

457
00:22:55,065 --> 00:22:56,185
Lord Meng,

458
00:22:56,865 --> 00:22:58,745
give your new subordinates a name.

459
00:23:06,345 --> 00:23:07,305
Thank you, Your Majesty.

460
00:23:13,065 --> 00:23:14,105
From this day onward,

461
00:23:14,185 --> 00:23:16,345
you are the Light Riders
of the Office of Public Inquiry.

462
00:23:17,025 --> 00:23:19,145
Light as shadows, swift as wind.

463
00:23:19,745 --> 00:23:20,825
Blades unseen,

464
00:23:21,825 --> 00:23:22,865
death in a single strike.

465
00:23:25,065 --> 00:23:26,905
-Thank you for naming us, Lord Meng.
-Thank you for naming us, Lord Meng.

466
00:23:26,985 --> 00:23:29,545
-We swear our lives to the Office.
-We swear our lives to the Office.

467
00:23:29,625 --> 00:23:31,145
-We pledge loyalty to Lord Meng.
-We pledge loyalty to Lord Meng.

468
00:23:56,305 --> 00:23:57,785
I have summoned an imperial physician.

469
00:23:58,585 --> 00:23:59,425
He will arrive shortly.

470
00:24:06,185 --> 00:24:07,505
The rain truly has not stopped.

471
00:24:08,105 --> 00:24:09,545
Is Your Majesty not afraid
of a demoness like me?

472
00:24:10,105 --> 00:24:12,025
When did I ever say
I believed such nonsense?

473
00:24:13,145 --> 00:24:14,385
Your Ten Measures
to Reassure the People

474
00:24:14,465 --> 00:24:16,105
have all been implemented
by the Right Chancellor.

475
00:24:16,185 --> 00:24:17,425
The flood-control effort
is already succeeding.

476
00:24:20,985 --> 00:24:22,265
You dared draw your sword that day.

477
00:24:22,985 --> 00:24:24,865
the Left Chancellor might accuse you
of treason?

478
00:24:34,385 --> 00:24:35,785
The Tiger's Roar Gang
and its protector at court

479
00:24:35,865 --> 00:24:36,985
have yet to be eradicated.

480
00:24:37,625 --> 00:24:39,385
I forbid you to throw away

481
00:24:39,945 --> 00:24:41,905
your chance for personal vengeance
over a worthless bronze disk.

482
00:24:47,065 --> 00:24:48,185
I do not fear impeachment.

483
00:24:49,025 --> 00:24:50,905
Some things must be done by someone.

484
00:24:51,465 --> 00:24:52,305
Celestial signs,

485
00:24:53,305 --> 00:24:54,505
humiliation—

486
00:24:54,585 --> 00:24:55,705
all are meant to destroy my name.

487
00:24:57,345 --> 00:24:58,305
But I do not care.

488
00:24:58,865 --> 00:25:00,545
While they pontificate
from the Astronomical Observatory,

489
00:25:01,105 --> 00:25:02,785
I will tear apart their heavenly script

490
00:25:03,665 --> 00:25:04,585
and show them

491
00:25:05,345 --> 00:25:06,425
that their so-called divine punishment

492
00:25:07,145 --> 00:25:08,345
is nothing but a man-made lie.

493
00:25:15,945 --> 00:25:17,825
They used celestial signs to attack you

494
00:25:18,705 --> 00:25:20,225
only to express

495
00:25:20,305 --> 00:25:21,945
their opposition to my reforms.

496
00:25:22,625 --> 00:25:23,465
You have suffered for it.

497
00:25:24,025 --> 00:25:25,825
But I never believed
in those celestial signs.

498
00:25:26,825 --> 00:25:27,945
I believe in you.

499
00:25:31,105 --> 00:25:32,065
I do not feel wronged.

500
00:25:33,145 --> 00:25:34,505
Your Majesty wields me as a sword

501
00:25:34,585 --> 00:25:35,625
to cut away the court's corruption.

502
00:25:36,145 --> 00:25:37,265
That is my honor.

503
00:25:37,945 --> 00:25:39,745
Whether it is the darkness
or the one shielding it,

504
00:25:42,985 --> 00:25:44,385
I will investigate to the end.

505
00:25:45,105 --> 00:25:47,425
From now on,
I will act even more ruthlessly.

506
00:25:48,425 --> 00:25:49,905
What Your Majesty cannot do,

507
00:25:49,985 --> 00:25:50,945
I will do.

508
00:25:51,025 --> 00:25:53,065
I know you will not retreat easily.

509
00:25:53,745 --> 00:25:54,905
Besides the Light Riders,

510
00:25:54,985 --> 00:25:57,625
I will transfer Di Nian and Shen Zhishu
to the Office of Public Inquiry

511
00:25:57,705 --> 00:25:59,145
to help you investigate
the Tiger's Roar Gang.

512
00:25:59,225 --> 00:26:00,185
I, too,

513
00:26:01,065 --> 00:26:02,825
will fully support your actions.

514
00:26:05,945 --> 00:26:07,585
Thank you, Your Majesty.

515
00:26:18,385 --> 00:26:20,465
Since the composite sketch was posted,

516
00:26:21,025 --> 00:26:23,265
the Office has received
many valuable leads.

517
00:26:23,745 --> 00:26:26,225
I will follow every clue

518
00:26:26,305 --> 00:26:27,585
to find their hiding place

519
00:26:27,665 --> 00:26:28,865
and capture them all.

520
00:26:28,945 --> 00:26:29,865
I will go with you.

521
00:26:33,745 --> 00:26:35,985
Your Majesty brought
the Light Riders here today.

522
00:26:37,105 --> 00:26:38,745
Tomorrow, there will be more criticism.

523
00:26:38,825 --> 00:26:40,145
The officials already say

524
00:26:40,225 --> 00:26:41,585
I am greatly favored.

525
00:26:41,665 --> 00:26:43,705
Your Majesty should return early.

526
00:26:44,465 --> 00:26:45,305
Otherwise, tomorrow

527
00:26:45,385 --> 00:26:47,145
will bring another storm of blood.

528
00:26:47,785 --> 00:26:48,945
Sometimes,

529
00:26:49,545 --> 00:26:50,385
I truly wonder

530
00:26:55,785 --> 00:26:57,265
what kind of relationship

531
00:26:59,145 --> 00:27:00,745
exists between you and me.

532
00:27:05,665 --> 00:27:06,705
We use each other

533
00:27:09,185 --> 00:27:10,185
and need each other.

534
00:27:12,545 --> 00:27:13,905
We are sovereign and subject.

535
00:27:13,985 --> 00:27:16,025
Are we not even friends?

536
00:27:21,985 --> 00:27:23,305
Of course we are still friends.

537
00:27:23,865 --> 00:27:24,905
Long have I yearned for it.

538
00:27:26,585 --> 00:27:27,545
Yet it does not exist in this world.

539
00:27:35,505 --> 00:27:37,065
It does not exist in this world.

540
00:27:51,425 --> 00:27:52,265
Your Majesty,

541
00:27:53,145 --> 00:27:54,465
the sky has cleared.

542
00:28:18,545 --> 00:28:19,385
Wonderful!

543
00:28:21,225 --> 00:28:22,065
Wonderful!

544
00:28:23,185 --> 00:28:24,745
The floodwaters have receded
in every prefecture.

545
00:28:24,825 --> 00:28:27,905
The victims are settled,
and the fields suffered little damage.

546
00:28:31,665 --> 00:28:32,985
Your Majesty is wise.

547
00:28:33,065 --> 00:28:35,505
Even Heaven was moved
by Your Majesty's benevolence

548
00:28:35,585 --> 00:28:37,585
and cleared the skies for Daning.

549
00:28:37,665 --> 00:28:38,865
Look at the rainbow.

550
00:28:38,945 --> 00:28:40,905
Surely this is an auspicious sign.

551
00:28:40,985 --> 00:28:43,225
I recall a line from the classics:

552
00:28:43,305 --> 00:28:45,585
The course of Heaven is constant.

553
00:28:45,665 --> 00:28:46,585
It does not endure for Yao
or perish for Jie.

554
00:28:46,665 --> 00:28:47,505
Still,

555
00:28:48,185 --> 00:28:49,665
had we not rejected the objections

556
00:28:49,745 --> 00:28:51,065
and adopted Meng Tinghui's plan,

557
00:28:51,625 --> 00:28:53,265
even with the Right Chancellor's
experience and devotion,

558
00:28:53,345 --> 00:28:55,865
we might not have withstood
this once-in-a-century flood.

559
00:28:56,505 --> 00:28:58,065
Lord Meng deserves great credit.

560
00:28:58,545 --> 00:28:59,665
Her Ten Measures
to Reassure the People

561
00:28:59,745 --> 00:29:00,865
even amazed the veteran officials
of the Ministry of Works.

562
00:29:00,945 --> 00:29:01,865
They were full of praise.

563
00:29:03,465 --> 00:29:04,865
When the Right Chancellor returns,

564
00:29:04,945 --> 00:29:05,945
I will hold a victory banquet.

565
00:29:06,665 --> 00:29:08,265
No one who deserves reward
shall be overlooked.

566
00:29:08,825 --> 00:29:09,665
Your Maj—

567
00:29:10,585 --> 00:29:12,145
-Never mind.
-Say what you wish.

568
00:29:12,865 --> 00:29:13,705
Your Majesty,

569
00:29:14,665 --> 00:29:16,145
there have been troubling rumors

570
00:29:16,225 --> 00:29:18,225
throughout the court and the capital.

571
00:29:18,305 --> 00:29:19,265
About Meng Tinghui?

572
00:29:19,345 --> 00:29:20,945
No. About Your Majesty.

573
00:29:21,505 --> 00:29:22,385
They say that day,

574
00:29:23,545 --> 00:29:25,665
at the hot spring,

575
00:29:26,225 --> 00:29:27,105
while Wen Ruomei attended Your Majesty,

576
00:29:27,185 --> 00:29:28,905
she confessed her love to you.

577
00:29:28,985 --> 00:29:30,345
On a sudden impulse,

578
00:29:30,425 --> 00:29:31,905
Your Majesty bedded her that night

579
00:29:32,465 --> 00:29:34,585
and promised that once the floods ended,

580
00:29:34,665 --> 00:29:35,905
you would make her a consort.

581
00:29:35,985 --> 00:29:36,905
Your Majesty,

582
00:29:38,025 --> 00:29:40,185
these rumors spread
under suspicious circumstances.

583
00:29:40,865 --> 00:29:41,865
They may not be entirely baseless.

584
00:29:41,945 --> 00:29:44,465
Should we tighten palace security
against any plot?

585
00:29:44,545 --> 00:29:45,785
Even if they are baseless,

586
00:29:45,865 --> 00:29:47,945
they damage Your Majesty's authority.

587
00:29:48,025 --> 00:29:49,025
You have some nerve saying that.

588
00:29:52,745 --> 00:29:54,905
The Left Chancellor is truly impatient.

589
00:29:55,545 --> 00:29:57,705
He thinks gossip alone
can force my hand.

590
00:29:57,785 --> 00:29:59,345
Now that the floods have receded,

591
00:30:00,105 --> 00:30:01,145
I will issue a decree today.

592
00:30:02,385 --> 00:30:04,585
Your Majesty, you agree?

593
00:30:04,665 --> 00:30:05,505
Of course.

594
00:30:06,225 --> 00:30:08,825
Today, I will give him
an answer that satisfies him.

595
00:30:08,905 --> 00:30:10,425
Your Majesty is wise.

596
00:30:19,545 --> 00:30:21,505
My lord, everyone is here.

597
00:30:21,585 --> 00:30:23,665
We can begin compiling
the leads on Ling Yunfei.

598
00:30:23,745 --> 00:30:25,225
Did His Majesty not say
he would come today?

599
00:30:25,945 --> 00:30:27,345
Today is the auspicious day
His Majesty chose

600
00:30:27,425 --> 00:30:28,945
to send the Wen family
the decree to take a consort.

601
00:30:29,025 --> 00:30:30,625
How could he possibly get away?

602
00:30:30,705 --> 00:30:32,705
Is His Majesty truly going
to marry Wen Ruomei?

603
00:30:34,505 --> 00:30:36,425
What does Wen Ruomei look like?

604
00:30:36,945 --> 00:30:38,305
Enough.

605
00:30:38,385 --> 00:30:39,985
His Majesty taking a consort
is an affair of state.

606
00:30:40,665 --> 00:30:43,025
We must also press on with our case.

607
00:30:43,905 --> 00:30:46,065
The Tiger's Roar Gang
was founded only five years ago,

608
00:30:46,625 --> 00:30:48,145
yet it has infiltrated local powers

609
00:30:48,785 --> 00:30:51,385
and colluded deeply
with officials in the capital.

610
00:30:51,945 --> 00:30:54,305
Ling Yunfei is still young.

611
00:30:54,385 --> 00:30:55,865
For him to wield such influence,

612
00:30:56,905 --> 00:30:59,505
could it be related
to his family background?

613
00:30:59,585 --> 00:31:00,425
I investigated.

614
00:31:01,185 --> 00:31:02,065
Ling Yunfei's mother

615
00:31:02,145 --> 00:31:03,145
was a courtesan.

616
00:31:03,865 --> 00:31:05,425
He grew up in hardship beside her.

617
00:31:05,505 --> 00:31:06,865
No one knows who his father is.

618
00:31:07,425 --> 00:31:09,905
They say he was a scoundrel
who abandoned wife and child.

619
00:31:09,985 --> 00:31:11,025
You suspected earlier

620
00:31:11,105 --> 00:31:12,305
that Wanxiang House was involved.

621
00:31:12,785 --> 00:31:13,625
Why did you not say so sooner?

622
00:31:15,105 --> 00:31:17,505
Since Ling Yunfei's mother
was a courtesan,

623
00:31:17,585 --> 00:31:19,545
could Wanxiang House and Ling Yunfei

624
00:31:20,185 --> 00:31:22,305
truly be closely connected?

625
00:31:23,625 --> 00:31:24,945
There is one more thing.

626
00:31:25,745 --> 00:31:27,065
Recently, Wanxiang House began selling

627
00:31:27,145 --> 00:31:29,225
a miracle drug
called the Infinite Bliss Pill.

628
00:31:29,305 --> 00:31:30,665
It supposedly heightens pleasure
and cures illness,

629
00:31:30,745 --> 00:31:31,945
but quickly causes severe addiction.

630
00:31:32,985 --> 00:31:34,265
It is costly and hard to obtain.

631
00:31:34,345 --> 00:31:36,465
It has become a fashionable indulgence
among wealthy merchants.

632
00:31:36,545 --> 00:31:37,665
I verified it.

633
00:31:38,185 --> 00:31:39,305
The Infinite Bliss Pill

634
00:31:39,385 --> 00:31:41,105
is distributed by Xiangning,

635
00:31:41,185 --> 00:31:42,425
the leading courtesan
of Wanxiang House.

636
00:31:42,985 --> 00:31:44,305
It is extremely scarce on the market.

637
00:31:44,385 --> 00:31:45,465
Some men

638
00:31:45,545 --> 00:31:47,465
are so desperate to obtain one pill

639
00:31:47,545 --> 00:31:48,665
that they sell their daughters

640
00:31:48,745 --> 00:31:49,825
to Wanxiang House.

641
00:31:50,385 --> 00:31:51,225
My lord,

642
00:31:51,625 --> 00:31:52,465
some citizens report

643
00:31:53,185 --> 00:31:54,025
that recently they saw

644
00:31:54,105 --> 00:31:55,905
a man resembling Ling Yunfei
entering Wanxiang House.

645
00:31:55,985 --> 00:31:57,425
The Infinite Bliss Pill

646
00:31:57,505 --> 00:31:59,425
is almost certainly
a Tiger's Roar Gang operation.

647
00:32:00,585 --> 00:32:01,425
I suggest

648
00:32:02,065 --> 00:32:03,505
we begin with the leading courtesan,

649
00:32:04,105 --> 00:32:06,465
follow the trail,
and find Ling Yunfei.

650
00:32:06,545 --> 00:32:07,865
It seems Wanxiang House

651
00:32:08,625 --> 00:32:09,825
must be investigated.

652
00:32:10,625 --> 00:32:11,465
My lord,

653
00:32:11,945 --> 00:32:13,305
I will go with you.

654
00:32:13,385 --> 00:32:15,185
Tell me immediately
when there is news.

655
00:32:19,705 --> 00:32:20,905
Such a place of pleasure

656
00:32:21,425 --> 00:32:23,025
would damage your reputation.

657
00:32:23,985 --> 00:32:25,745
Should you lose yourself there,

658
00:32:26,305 --> 00:32:27,425
you may stray far from the right path.

659
00:32:30,985 --> 00:32:31,985
I am better suited to go.

660
00:32:32,585 --> 00:32:33,745
I have taken many wrong turns

661
00:32:34,345 --> 00:32:35,585
and have plenty of experience.

662
00:32:35,665 --> 00:32:37,945
Too many people
may only complicate matters.

663
00:32:38,745 --> 00:32:39,585
This time,

664
00:32:40,185 --> 00:32:41,225
I will go alone.

665
00:32:50,345 --> 00:32:51,505
You ungrateful son!

666
00:32:52,385 --> 00:32:54,145
If you take one step
outside this residence today,

667
00:32:54,225 --> 00:32:56,585
you are no descendant of the Xu family!

668
00:32:56,665 --> 00:32:58,465
-You stopped me finding her in the rain—
-Chancellor.

669
00:32:58,545 --> 00:32:59,545
You called her a demoness.

670
00:32:59,625 --> 00:33:01,345
Now the sky is clear.
She is no demoness anymore.

671
00:33:01,425 --> 00:33:03,945
Why can I not see her?
I am going!

672
00:33:04,025 --> 00:33:05,505
Seize him!

673
00:33:07,065 --> 00:33:09,225
-Chancellor!
-You cannot stop me!

674
00:33:09,305 --> 00:33:10,705
Meng Tinghui, I am coming to see you!

675
00:33:10,785 --> 00:33:12,065
Chancellor,

676
00:33:12,145 --> 00:33:13,505
please calm down.

677
00:33:13,585 --> 00:33:15,385
Ze'er is young and impetuous.

678
00:33:15,465 --> 00:33:16,665
He was confused for a moment.

679
00:33:17,145 --> 00:33:19,065
You have always spoiled him.

680
00:33:19,145 --> 00:33:21,385
That is why he is so unruly.

681
00:33:21,465 --> 00:33:23,105
Yes, it is all my fault.

682
00:33:23,185 --> 00:33:24,465
Please calm down.

683
00:33:27,865 --> 00:33:29,825
Greetings, Your Majesty.

684
00:33:33,185 --> 00:33:34,105
My lady,

685
00:33:34,185 --> 00:33:35,625
word has spread everywhere

686
00:33:35,705 --> 00:33:37,825
that His Majesty personally promised

687
00:33:37,905 --> 00:33:39,905
once the disaster had passed,

688
00:33:39,985 --> 00:33:41,265
he would issue an imperial decree,

689
00:33:41,345 --> 00:33:42,625
welcome you into the palace,

690
00:33:42,705 --> 00:33:43,825
and make you a consort.

691
00:33:46,345 --> 00:33:47,305
Let us practice once more.

692
00:33:53,865 --> 00:33:55,145
You clumsy fool!

693
00:33:55,225 --> 00:33:56,465
If you ruin my face,

694
00:33:56,545 --> 00:33:57,785
how many heads do you have
to repay me with?

695
00:33:57,865 --> 00:33:59,225
Please forgive me, my lady.

696
00:33:59,305 --> 00:34:00,585
I was careless.

697
00:34:00,665 --> 00:34:01,945
I deserve to be slapped.

698
00:34:02,025 --> 00:34:03,585
With so little sense,

699
00:34:03,665 --> 00:34:05,305
how will you serve me
in the palace one day?

700
00:34:06,305 --> 00:34:08,265
If you are this clumsy
before His Majesty,

701
00:34:08,345 --> 00:34:10,385
you will make me a laughingstock.

702
00:34:10,465 --> 00:34:11,945
You are right to scold me, my lady.

703
00:34:12,025 --> 00:34:13,945
I will learn the rules properly.

704
00:34:14,025 --> 00:34:14,905
Enough.

705
00:34:15,625 --> 00:34:16,745
I am tired.

706
00:34:16,825 --> 00:34:17,985
Let me rest.

707
00:34:20,465 --> 00:34:21,305
My lady,

708
00:34:21,385 --> 00:34:22,785
this is a gelatin soup
from Dong'e County,

709
00:34:22,865 --> 00:34:26,785
stewed from the finest
donkey-hide gelatin.

710
00:34:26,865 --> 00:34:28,185
They say that after drinking it,

711
00:34:28,265 --> 00:34:29,705
it nourishes the blood and vitality

712
00:34:29,785 --> 00:34:31,505
and makes the complexion radiant.

713
00:34:41,105 --> 00:34:42,025
Something this fine—

714
00:34:42,105 --> 00:34:44,185
-I want it every day from now on.
-Yes.

715
00:34:44,265 --> 00:34:46,065
Mei'er!

716
00:34:46,145 --> 00:34:47,745
Quickly!

717
00:34:48,545 --> 00:34:50,065
Come receive the imperial decree!

718
00:34:50,145 --> 00:34:51,865
Father, the decree is here!

719
00:34:51,945 --> 00:34:54,025
Did His Majesty decree
that I am to marry him?

720
00:34:54,105 --> 00:34:55,105
Do not speak nonsense.

721
00:34:55,185 --> 00:34:56,265
Perhaps His Majesty

722
00:34:56,345 --> 00:34:57,985
has bestowed something valuable

723
00:34:58,065 --> 00:34:59,065
upon the Chancellor.

724
00:34:59,145 --> 00:34:59,985
Nonsense.

725
00:35:00,985 --> 00:35:01,985
Proclaim the decree.

726
00:35:07,465 --> 00:35:09,425
I find that

727
00:35:09,505 --> 00:35:12,425
Xu Runze, son of Left Chancellor Xu Ting,

728
00:35:12,505 --> 00:35:16,225
and Wen Ruomei,
daughter of Minister Wen Tao,

729
00:35:16,305 --> 00:35:17,665
are well matched in age

730
00:35:17,745 --> 00:35:19,265
and compatible in character.

731
00:35:19,345 --> 00:35:21,665
Both are exceptional talents,

732
00:35:21,745 --> 00:35:23,625
well suited to each other.

733
00:35:23,705 --> 00:35:26,625
To complete this
heaven-made match,

734
00:35:26,705 --> 00:35:28,305
I hereby decree their marriage.

735
00:35:28,385 --> 00:35:32,825
Wen Ruomei shall wed Xu Runze

736
00:35:32,905 --> 00:35:35,265
and form a lifelong union.

737
00:35:35,345 --> 00:35:37,865
They shall marry on an auspicious day.

738
00:35:37,945 --> 00:35:40,225
They shall marry on an auspicious day.

739
00:35:40,305 --> 00:35:41,905
Xu Runze?

740
00:35:41,985 --> 00:35:44,185
The fool who drooled at seven,

741
00:35:44,265 --> 00:35:45,665
wet the bed at ten,

742
00:35:45,745 --> 00:35:48,425
and at thirteen recited
"Man's beginning" as "pig's beginning"?

743
00:35:48,505 --> 00:35:49,705
That idiot son of the Xu family?

744
00:35:50,865 --> 00:35:53,025
Left Chancellor, accept the decree.

745
00:36:03,825 --> 00:36:05,945
Could this decree be mistaken?

746
00:36:06,025 --> 00:36:07,585
My daughter is intelligent and virtuous.

747
00:36:07,665 --> 00:36:08,945
Her heart belongs to His Majesty.

748
00:36:09,025 --> 00:36:11,305
She is not suited to Young Master Xu.

749
00:36:11,385 --> 00:36:12,505
This match is inappropriate.

750
00:36:13,145 --> 00:36:14,065
Minister Wen,

751
00:36:15,105 --> 00:36:16,665
do you intend to defy the decree?

752
00:36:16,745 --> 00:36:17,945
No.

753
00:36:18,025 --> 00:36:19,505
I would not dare.

754
00:36:27,745 --> 00:36:29,025
I refuse to marry

755
00:36:29,105 --> 00:36:30,945
that stupid woman!

756
00:36:31,025 --> 00:36:33,345
Mother, I will not marry her!

757
00:36:33,425 --> 00:36:34,265
If I marry her,

758
00:36:34,345 --> 00:36:36,265
I may as well become a monk!

759
00:36:36,785 --> 00:36:38,745
Chancellor, will you truly make Ze'er

760
00:36:38,825 --> 00:36:40,225
marry Wen Ruomei?

761
00:36:40,305 --> 00:36:41,945
Father, say something!

762
00:36:42,025 --> 00:36:44,625
-Say something, Father!
-You must stand up for Ze'er!

763
00:36:45,265 --> 00:36:46,225
Father,

764
00:36:46,305 --> 00:36:47,185
go beg His Majesty

765
00:36:47,265 --> 00:36:49,585
-to withdraw the decree!
-Enough!

766
00:36:49,665 --> 00:36:51,105
An imperial decree is no game.

767
00:36:52,225 --> 00:36:53,185
This is all your fault.

768
00:36:53,785 --> 00:36:55,385
You insisted I enter the palace
to win His Majesty's favor.

769
00:36:55,465 --> 00:36:56,905
That is why he humiliated me like this.

770
00:36:58,305 --> 00:37:00,065
My dream of becoming Empress!

771
00:37:00,145 --> 00:37:00,985
My lady!

772
00:37:01,665 --> 00:37:02,505
My lady!

773
00:37:03,065 --> 00:37:04,225
My lady, slow down!

774
00:37:17,345 --> 00:37:19,385
Young Master,
a young woman is asking to see you.

775
00:37:19,465 --> 00:37:20,905
My thoughts are unsettled today.

776
00:37:20,985 --> 00:37:21,825
I should not receive visitors.

777
00:37:22,185 --> 00:37:23,025
Turn her away for me.

778
00:37:23,105 --> 00:37:24,385
But the young woman says

779
00:37:24,465 --> 00:37:26,465
she is Proprietor Yan
of Bofeng Tavern.

780
00:37:26,545 --> 00:37:28,225
How imposing you have become,
Lord Shen.

781
00:37:29,665 --> 00:37:30,825
I wondered who it was.

782
00:37:30,905 --> 00:37:32,305
So it is Proprietor Yan.

783
00:37:32,385 --> 00:37:33,345
What is it?

784
00:37:33,425 --> 00:37:34,665
Has a new grape wine arrived,

785
00:37:34,745 --> 00:37:36,785
or has Bofeng Tavern
invented another dish

786
00:37:36,865 --> 00:37:38,625
worthy of your personal visit?

787
00:37:38,705 --> 00:37:39,625
Since the state liquor monopoly decree,

788
00:37:40,105 --> 00:37:41,665
official distilleries
have dominated the market.

789
00:37:42,305 --> 00:37:43,945
Bofeng Tavern is about to run out
of Three Whites liquor.

790
00:37:44,905 --> 00:37:46,825
You oversee this matter, Lord Shen.

791
00:37:46,905 --> 00:37:48,265
Surely you knew.

792
00:37:48,345 --> 00:37:49,505
The court's new decree

793
00:37:49,585 --> 00:37:50,865
is meant to restore order
to the market.

794
00:37:51,425 --> 00:37:53,705
Bofeng Tavern is highly prominent.

795
00:37:53,785 --> 00:37:55,305
You should set an example.

796
00:37:55,385 --> 00:37:57,345
The state distilleries
cannot make the flavor I want.

797
00:37:58,185 --> 00:38:00,505
You tasted the finest Three Whites

798
00:38:01,065 --> 00:38:01,945
and praised it yourself:

799
00:38:02,945 --> 00:38:04,265
fierce as the frontier wind,

800
00:38:04,345 --> 00:38:05,705
mellow as the affection of an old friend.

801
00:38:06,025 --> 00:38:07,945
How can the rigid taste
of state-made liquor compare?

802
00:38:09,705 --> 00:38:10,825
Lord Shen,

803
00:38:10,905 --> 00:38:13,105
surely you would not let
this taste of home disappear.

804
00:38:13,185 --> 00:38:14,705
You are unusually agitated.

805
00:38:16,265 --> 00:38:17,945
Are you asking me for a favor?

806
00:38:19,505 --> 00:38:21,025
I am reasoning
with the Imperial Survey Commissioner.

807
00:38:21,105 --> 00:38:23,505
Dozens of people at Bofeng Tavern

808
00:38:23,585 --> 00:38:24,905
and the veteran craftsmen

809
00:38:24,985 --> 00:38:26,625
who followed me from Shazhou
to the capital

810
00:38:27,185 --> 00:38:28,945
depend on me for their livelihood.

811
00:38:32,705 --> 00:38:33,545
Look carefully.

812
00:38:34,105 --> 00:38:35,945
Licensed merchants
jointly guaranteed by the Three Offices

813
00:38:36,825 --> 00:38:38,665
may retain their existing suppliers.

814
00:38:40,785 --> 00:38:41,865
Your special permit

815
00:38:42,425 --> 00:38:44,305
was delivered three days ago.

816
00:38:48,945 --> 00:38:51,225
So you deliberately kept it from me

817
00:38:51,825 --> 00:38:52,665
and waited for me to come here?

818
00:38:53,505 --> 00:38:54,345
Yes.

819
00:38:55,385 --> 00:38:56,865
Whenever you come to find me,

820
00:38:56,945 --> 00:38:58,385
you are either negotiating for business

821
00:38:58,465 --> 00:39:00,065
or pleading for someone else.

822
00:39:04,745 --> 00:39:05,585
Yan Fuzhi,

823
00:39:06,065 --> 00:39:07,065
when will you ever

824
00:39:08,185 --> 00:39:10,065
come just once

825
00:39:10,945 --> 00:39:11,785
solely for Shen Zhishu?

826
00:39:20,945 --> 00:39:22,025
Lord Shen,

827
00:39:25,825 --> 00:39:27,305
has anyone ever told you

828
00:39:28,385 --> 00:39:29,705
that you are very handsome?

829
00:39:30,665 --> 00:39:32,385
Especially those eyes.

830
00:39:33,145 --> 00:39:34,425
You look at everyone
with such tenderness.

831
00:39:36,185 --> 00:39:37,305
But...

832
00:39:37,985 --> 00:39:39,265
I only like your face.

833
00:39:39,345 --> 00:39:40,545
I do not trust the man behind it.

834
00:39:41,865 --> 00:39:43,505
-What do you not trust?
-I do not believe

835
00:39:43,585 --> 00:39:46,465
that Lord Shen,
surrounded by noble ladies in the capital,

836
00:39:47,385 --> 00:39:49,785
would truly abandon
all those blooming beauties

837
00:39:49,865 --> 00:39:51,865
to pledge himself

838
00:39:52,345 --> 00:39:53,665
to a merchant's daughter like me

839
00:39:53,745 --> 00:39:54,785
for a lifetime.

840
00:39:55,985 --> 00:39:57,385
Nor do I trust myself

841
00:39:58,265 --> 00:39:59,945
to choose one tree like you

842
00:40:00,785 --> 00:40:01,625
and give up

843
00:40:01,705 --> 00:40:03,625
the countless handsome men
I may meet in the future.

844
00:40:04,785 --> 00:40:05,625
That bargain

845
00:40:06,865 --> 00:40:07,745
would not be worthwhile.

846
00:40:10,425 --> 00:40:11,945
I will take the permit.

847
00:40:12,025 --> 00:40:12,865
Thank you.

848
00:40:15,265 --> 00:40:16,425
How do you know
my feelings are not sincere?

849
00:40:18,745 --> 00:40:20,585
Your past romantic exploits

850
00:40:20,665 --> 00:40:21,545
are known to everyone.

851
00:40:22,505 --> 00:40:24,185
You charm women effortlessly.

852
00:40:24,865 --> 00:40:25,745
Shen Zhishu,

853
00:40:27,025 --> 00:40:27,905
if this is only a game,

854
00:40:28,385 --> 00:40:29,985
I, Yan Fuzhi, will gladly play along.

855
00:40:34,745 --> 00:40:35,785
But if you are sincere,

856
00:40:39,985 --> 00:40:41,465
show me proof of it.

857
00:40:47,465 --> 00:40:48,785
What if I cut away
every romantic entanglement?

858
00:40:53,385 --> 00:40:54,585
Then...

859
00:40:54,665 --> 00:40:56,345
clear away all the flowers and weeds
around you

860
00:40:56,425 --> 00:40:57,345
until none remain.

861
00:40:59,985 --> 00:41:01,025
Then come ask me again.

862
00:41:30,265 --> 00:41:31,905
The customers who came before

863
00:41:32,465 --> 00:41:34,345
were either rich but ugly,

864
00:41:34,425 --> 00:41:35,905
vulgar beyond endurance,

865
00:41:36,785 --> 00:41:38,465
or handsome but poor,

866
00:41:39,185 --> 00:41:41,225
with empty purses.

867
00:41:41,785 --> 00:41:44,945
It is rare to meet a gentleman like you,

868
00:41:45,025 --> 00:41:46,825
who has both looks and wealth.

869
00:41:48,425 --> 00:41:49,665
I do not believe you.

870
00:41:50,265 --> 00:41:53,185
I hear your admirers, Miss Xiangning,

871
00:41:53,265 --> 00:41:54,745
are all rich or powerful.

872
00:41:56,265 --> 00:41:57,545
Even the renowned

873
00:41:57,625 --> 00:41:58,985
leader of the Tiger's Roar Gang

874
00:41:59,665 --> 00:42:01,425
is said to be utterly captivated by you

875
00:42:01,985 --> 00:42:03,105
and visits often to support you.

876
00:42:04,025 --> 00:42:07,305
The court offers ten thousand taels
for that villain.

877
00:42:07,825 --> 00:42:09,265
If I knew him,

878
00:42:09,345 --> 00:42:10,865
I would already be rich.

